{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementCategory","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementCategory","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementCategory","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementCategory","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L83-L92","doc":"**Confinement category.** Associativity of composition holds on\nthe kind-preserving model: composing on either side with `h`\nreduces by `match` to `h.kind P S` whichever way you parenthesise.\nWitnessed by `rfl`-style evaluation after `cases h`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:confinement-category","label":"def:confinement-category","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfComp_right_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfComp_right_id","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L78-L81","doc":"The right-identity law `ConfComp f (ConfId P) = f` for every `f`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfComp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfComp","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L63-L76","doc":"Composition of confinement morphisms — concrete pick: preserve\nthe morphism *kind* of the outer-applied morphism `g`, with new\nendpoints `(P, R)`.  This satisfies the right-identity law\n`f ∘ id_P = f` because `match f with | unfold _ _ ⇒ unfold P Q`\nrebuilds `f` itself when `f = unfold P Q` (and similarly for\n`fold` / `dress`).  The earlier \"always return `unfold`\" model\nfailed the identity law for `dress`/`fold` morphisms. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfId","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfId","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L58-L61","doc":"Identity morphism on any object — concrete pick. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.dress","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.dress","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L54-L56","doc":"Dress `P_bare` with an electron shell (strand count grows by Z). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.fold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.fold","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L52-L53","doc":"Fold `P` to a coarser representation `P'` (strand count shrinks). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.unfold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.unfold","kind":"ctor","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L50-L51","doc":"Unfold `P` to a finer representation `P'` (strand count grows). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism","kind":"inductive","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L45-L56","doc":"Morphism family in the confinement category: unfolding (to a\nfiner level), folding (to a coarser level), or dressing\n(attach an electron shell). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprConfinedParticleTy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprConfinedParticleTy","kind":"instance","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instReprConfinedParticleTy.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instReprConfinedParticleTy.repr","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.colourCharge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.colourCharge","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Total colour charge (mod 3 sum of strand colours). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.strands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.strands","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Number of strands in the confined particle's braid representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticleTy","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-category.lean#L29-L43","doc":"Concrete model of confined-particle data.\n\nCaptures the two minimal physical observables of a confined\nparticle: its braid-strand count and its total colour charge\n(mod 3 sum of strand colours).  These are content-bearing\nfields; the categorical-axiom theorems below never inspect them\nDownstream proofs continue to close by `rfl`-style\nevaluation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}